# Portfolio header links

Do not use hash hrefs (`/#home`, `/#projects`) in the main site header or hero CTA.

- Home scrolls to the top of the page (`window.scrollTo`); Projects scrolls with a small offset above the section (~40px) so it clears the sticky header
- Keep section `id` attributes for targeting where needed; do not put them in the address bar
- Active nav state should follow the visible section, not mark every home-page link as current
